/*

ANNUAL BIOMASS MAPPING WORKFLOW
  Per-feature (polygon) pipeline for producing annual biomass time series over 
  FeatureCollections (e.g. fire perimeters, sample areas). Exports one image per feature
  per pipeline stage, with all years stacked as bands in each image.

  All scripts are Python (earthengine-api). 
  Run with CWD set to scripts/gee/ so that utils/ and ccdc_tools/ imports resolve. 
  See utils/pipeline.py for shared functions.

DEPENDENCIES (from full_workflow/ pipeline, run once):
  - CCDC outputs (module 03)
  - Seasonal DOYs and illumination condition (modules 04-05)
  - Auxiliary predictor assets: ecoregions, permafrost, WTE, zones, tree cover (module 06)
  - Formatted GEE decision-tree model files in GCS (R modules 11-12)
  - Shortened model files in GCS (00_1_modfiles_shorten_strings.py below)

00_ PRE-PROCESSING (run once per model version)
  00_0_modfiles_ecoregion_lookup     - generate ecoregion short-code lookup; write to utils/params.py
  00_1_modfiles_shorten_strings      - shorten R tree files in GCS (final_trees → final_trees_shortened)

01_ SEASONAL REFLECTANCE (run per batch)
  01_0_run_annual_reflectance        - compute CCDC-modeled reflectance + topo correction; one image per feature, all years as bands

01_ MODEL INFERENCE (run per batch, after Phase 1)
  01_1_run_annual_binary_continuous  - run 100 MC binary + continuous models; aggregate and export continuous and binary images (all years as bands)

01_ FINAL BIOMASS MAPS (run per batch, after Phase 2)
  01_2_run_annual_final_biomass      - apply binary masking + ecological constraint; export final biomass maps (all years as bands)

*/
